<title>USA: New Boston, Texas, won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>New Boston, Texas, won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co., Inc. said it won $1.500 million of New Boston, Texas general obligation limited tax Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.0614 percent.</p>
